For the test suite, I tested and fixed two bugs:
- the first one was that the original implementation used big-endian byte order for base64 conversion. For this I created a test suite that ensured the base64 conversion used little endian as required.
- the second one was that the program didn't handle zero values correctly for base64 conversion. For this I created a test suite that verifies that zero can be encoded and produces a valid base64 string.

For extra credit I created a test suite that tested things like infinity values, long texts, special characters, negative numbers, zero, decimals, malformed padding across many conversions.
